Modify the CategoryRouter component to pass the 'category' parameter to the router function as follows:

```javascript
const CategoryRouter = ({ category }) => {
  return (
    <Router>
      <Route path={`/category/${category}`} component={CategoryPage} />
    </Router>
  );
};
```

This ensures that the 'category' parameter is correctly passed to the router function and used in the route path.
